{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balladrion</strong> is a rogue-lite survival game set in a fairy-tale fantasy world, developed by a single passionate creator. Every run matters and makes you stronger. With new skills and upgrades, you fight your way through maps, biomes, and hordes of enemies while gradually uncovering your story and the true meaning of your existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/dc45f7c66a5734b517a611fe0b108d8b.avif?t=1768831146\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in thrilling battles and fight against endless waves of diverse enemies. Complete quests and events, discover merchants, and make use of active map abilities. Every battle is an opportunity to combine unique skills and prepare for even greater challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/e237d04173db3879e6d5505fc938760b.poster.avif?t=1768831146\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/e237d04173db3879e6d5505fc938760b.webm?t=1768831146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/e237d04173db3879e6d5505fc938760b.mp4?t=1768831146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/082e28b7ce8428e1c91c14c513ac57f8.avif?t=1768831146\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome and map is unique, offering its own missions, challenges, and enemies. Discover new possibilities and refine your strategy, adapting to new difficulties that force you to plan and improvise. This ensures that every run is slightly different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/32d98b78e68b444fabed3626c9699239.poster.avif?t=1768831146\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/32d98b78e68b444fabed3626c9699239.webm?t=1768831146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/32d98b78e68b444fabed3626c9699239.mp4?t=1768831146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/17e1835a681b8c768e86b5f969544229.avif?t=1768831146\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your skills, armor, bows, potions, abilities, and much more. Each upgrade increases your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/9fadb6decce35c98be2e1ec54fd5b286.poster.avif?t=1768831146\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/9fadb6decce35c98be2e1ec54fd5b286.webm?t=1768831146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/9fadb6decce35c98be2e1ec54fd5b286.mp4?t=1768831146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/71cb70b3121c03646efaefceff7e2183.avif?t=1768831146\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new \u201cboons\u201d that enhance your chances of survival and experiment with their various combinations. Find your ideal playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/852cb910cbc74981033d8605d1d3bf2c.poster.avif?t=1768831146\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/852cb910cbc74981033d8605d1d3bf2c.webm?t=1768831146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/34b505188accb6781631f6fd62576d56.avif?t=1768831146\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An important part of the game is also gathering and mining materials \u2013 wood, stone, herbs, Glacialite, Infernite, and other mystical resources. Use them to craft, upgrade your equipment, and unlock new possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/e37215014187ce5d741b88780fbb6aa8.poster.avif?t=1768831146\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/e37215014187ce5d741b88780fbb6aa8.webm?t=1768831146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/e37215014187ce5d741b88780fbb6aa8.mp4?t=1768831146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/51b86e5e573e96a8739511c41078e0ce.avif?t=1768831146\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue-lite third-person action with a focus on variety and randomness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining and crafting \u2013 collect resources and unlock upgrades for your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random skills, upgrades, and boons in every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stylized magical world full of enemies and loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short timed events (\u201cLucky/Unlucky Minute\u201d) with unpredictable effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story fragments revealed through visual visions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade armor, weapons, and potions with diverse build options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed entirely by a solo creator</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/81140ef03651dfba0f7a00252333979b.poster.avif?t=1768831146\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/81140ef03651dfba0f7a00252333979b.webm?t=1768831146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/81140ef03651dfba0f7a00252333979b.mp4?t=1768831146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756740?t=1768831146","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756740?t=1768831146","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/45a78d1895ae00e0913118ee5da37ad0f4487557/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768831146","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/45a78d1895ae00e0913118ee5da37ad0f4487557/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768831146","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4235510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balladrion</strong> is a rogue-lite survival game set in a fairy-tale fantasy world, developed by a single passionate creator. Every run matters and makes you stronger. With new skills and upgrades, you fight your way through maps, biomes, and hordes of enemies while gradually uncovering your story and the true meaning of your existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/dc45f7c66a5734b517a611fe0b108d8b.avif?t=1768831146\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in thrilling battles and fight against endless waves of diverse enemies. Complete quests and events, discover merchants, and make use of active map abilities. Every battle is an opportunity to combine unique skills and prepare for even greater challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/e237d04173db3879e6d5505fc938760b.poster.avif?t=1768831146\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/e237d04173db3879e6d5505fc938760b.webm?t=1768831146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/e23